Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(ui): feedback reads the clear-toolpath undo hint
 through chord()

The status line now names the platform's command key, so on macOS it
says "Cmd+Z restores"; the feedback suite still matched "Ctrl+Z" and
failed there. Assert through shortcut_keys::chord like the twin does.

Refs #1239

